  "nodes": [
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 120,
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f6g7h1",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "pinctrl_bind_pins 函数完整分析\n设备树 → 引脚绑定全流程",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": -250,
      "y": -900
    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 260,
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f6g7h2",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "执行时机：really_probe()\n路径：drivers/base/dd.c\n\n调用顺序:\n1. dev->driver = drv (绑定驱动)\n2. pinctrl_bind_pins(dev) ⭐\n3. drv->probe(dev) (驱动 probe)\n\n作用：在驱动 probe 之前完成引脚复用配置",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": -250,
      "y": -730
    },
    {
      "color": "5",
      "height": 320,
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f6g7h3",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "struct dev_pin_info\n路径：include/linux/pinctrl/consumer.h\n\n成员:\n• struct pinctrl *p\n  引脚控制器指针\n• struct pinctrl_state *default_state\n  默认状态 (normal operation)\n• struct pinctrl_state *init_state\n  初始化状态\n• struct pinctrl_state *sleep_state\n  睡眠状态 (CONFIG_PM)\n• struct pinctrl_state *idle_state\n  空闲状态 (CONFIG_PM)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": -250,
      "y": -440
    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 380,
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f6g7h4",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "pinctrl_bind_pins 主流程\n路径：drivers/base/pinctrl.c\n\n1. 检查重用节点 (5-7 行)\n   dev->of_node_reused\n\n2. 分配 dev_pin_info (9-12 行)\n   devm_kzalloc()\n\n3. 获取 pinctrl 句柄 (14-20 行)\n   devm_pinctrl_get()\n   → pinctrl_get()\n   → create_pinctrl()\n\n4. 查找默认状态 (22-28 行)\n   pinctrl_lookup_state(DEFAULT)\n\n5. 查找初始化状态 (30-40 行)\n   pinctrl_lookup_state(INIT)\n   pinctrl_select_state()\n\n6. 查找 PM 状态 (50-62 行)\n   sleep_state, idle_state",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": -250,
      "y": -70
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 320,
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f6g7h5",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "create_pinctrl 函数\n路径：drivers/pinctrl/core.c\n\n执行流程:\n1. 分配 pinctrl 结构体\n   kzalloc(sizeof(*p))\n2. 初始化链表\n   states, dt_maps\n3. 转换设备树映射 ⭐\n   pinctrl_dt_to_map()\n4. 遍历 pinctrl_maps\n   for_each_maps()\n   add_setting()\n5. 初始化引用计数\n   kref_init()\n6. 添加到全局链表\n   list_add_tail()",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": -250,
      "y": 360
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 370,
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f6g7h6",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "关键设计要点\n\n• 设备树节点 → pinctrl_map 转换\n  pinctrl_dt_to_map()\n\n• default_state 与 pinctrl_map 关联\n  通过 dt_remember_or_free_map()\n\n• 映射注册到全局链表\n  pinctrl_register_mappings()\n\n• 激活状态应用配置\n  pinctrl_select_state()",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": -250,
      "y": 730
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 320,
      "id": "b1c2d3e4f5g6h7i2",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "pinctrl_dt_to_map 函数\n路径：drivers/pinctrl/core.c\n\n执行流程:\n1. 获取设备树节点\n   p->dev->of_node\n2. 遍历 pinctrl-0, pinctrl-1...\n   kasprintf(\"pinctrl-%d\")\n3. 读取 pinctrl-names\n   of_property_read_string_index()\n4. 解析每个引用节点\n   of_find_node_by_phandle()\n5. 调用子函数\n   dt_to_map_one_config()",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": 300,
      "y": -400
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 320,
      "id": "b1c2d3e4f5g6h7i3",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "dt_to_map_one_config 函数\n作用：解析单个配置节点\n\n执行流程:\n1. 查找引脚控制器设备\n   向上遍历父节点\n2. 获取 pinctrl_dev\n   get_pinctrl_dev_from_of_node()\n3. 检查 DT 支持\n   ops->dt_node_to_map\n4. 调用驱动方法 ⭐\n   ops->dt_node_to_map()\n5. 存储映射表\n   dt_remember_or_free_map()",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": 300,
      "y": -30
    },
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 320,
      "id": "c1d2e3f4g5h6i7j1",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "struct pinctrl\n路径：drivers/pinctrl/core.h\n\n成员:\n• struct list_head node\n  全局链表节点\n• struct device *dev\n  关联的设备\n• struct list_head states\n  状态链表头\n• struct pinctrl_state *state\n  当前活动状态\n• struct list_head dt_maps\n  设备树映射链表\n• struct kref users\n  引用计数",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": -800,
      "y": -70
    },
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 240,
      "id": "c1d2e3f4g5h6i7j2",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "struct pinctrl_maps\n路径：drivers/pinctrl/core.h\n\n成员:\n• struct list_head node\n  链表节点\n• const struct pinctrl_map *maps\n  映射数组指针\n• unsigned num_maps\n  映射数量",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": -800,
      "y": 300
    },
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 280,
      "id": "c1d2e3f4g5h6i7j3",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "struct pinctrl_dt_map\n路径：drivers/pinctrl/core.c\n\n成员:\n• struct list_head node\n  添加到 dt_maps 链表\n• struct pinctrl_dev *pctldev\n  引脚控制器设备\n• struct pinctrl_map *map\n  映射表条目数组\n• unsigned num_maps\n  映射数量",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": -800,
      "y": 590
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 200,
      "id": "c1d2e3f4g5h6i7j4",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "数据流向总结\n\n设备树节点\n  ↓ pinctrl_dt_to_map\ndt_to_map_one_config\n  ↓ dt_node_to_map (驱动)\ndt_remember_or_free_map\n  ↓ pinctrl_register_mappings\n全局 pinctrl_maps 链表\n  ↓ create_pinctrl\npinctrl 结构体",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": -800,
      "y": 920
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 320,
      "id": "d1e2f3g4h5i6j7k1",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "dt_remember_or_free_map 函数\n作用：存储<span style=\"background:#affad1\">映射表条目</span>\n\n执行流程:\n1. 初始化映射表字段 (9-22 行)\n   复制设备名称\n   设置 dev_name, name, ctrl_dev_name\n2. 分配 pinctrl_dt_map (25-32 行)\n   kzalloc()\n   添加到 p->dt_maps 链表\n3. 注册映射表 ⭐\n   pinctrl_register_mappings()",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": 300,
      "y": 360
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 320,
      "id": "d1e2f3g4h5i6j7k2",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "pinctrl_register_mappings 函数\n路径：drivers/pinctrl/core.c\n\n执行流程:\n1. 合法性检查 (18-64 行)\n   检查 dev_name, name\n   验证映射类型\n2. 分配 maps_node (66-73 行)\n   kzalloc()\n3. 添加到全局链表 (75-78 行)\n   list_add_tail(&pinctrl_maps)\n\n作用：注册映射表到 pinctrl 子系统",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": 300,
      "y": 730
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 200,
      "id": "d1e2f3g4h5i6j7k3",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "关键问题解答\n\nQ: default_state 与 pinctrl_map 如何关联？\n\nA: 通过以下流程:\n1. pinctrl_dt_to_map 解析设备树\n2. dt_to_map_one_config 调用驱动\n3. dt_remember_or_free_map 存储\n4. pinctrl_register_mappings 注册\n5. create_pinctrl 遍历 maps\n6. add_setting 建立关联",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1100
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 160,
      "id": "d1e2f3g4h5i6j7k4",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "该阶段核心操作\n\n大多为赋值操作和链表插入:\n• 复制设备名称\n• 设置映射表字段\n• 添加到 dt_maps 链表\n• 注册到全局 pinctrl_maps",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1350
    },
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 280,
      "id": "b1c2d3e4f5g6h7i1",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "设备树示例 (RS485)\n\nrk_485_ctl: rk-485-ctl {\n  compatible = \"topeet,rs485_ctl\";\n  gpios = <&gpio0 22 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;\n  pinctrl-names = \"default\";\n  pinctrl-0 = <&rk_485_gpio>;\n};\n\n&pinctrl {\n  rk_485 {\n    rk_485_gpio: rk-485-gpio {\n      rockchip,pins = <3 13 RK_FUNC_GPIO &pcfg_pull_none>;\n    };\n  };\n};",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 500,
      "x": 300,
      "y": -750
    }
  ]
}